  "transcription": "Approved For Release 2001/04/13 : CIA-RDP82-00457R007400170008-1\n\nCONFIDENTIAL\n\n25X1A\n\nComment. the same as reported by another source on 1 January 1951. See MC-11306. This indicates that probably the occupation of the airfield has not changed. Two ground attack regiments are believed to have been stationed in Doeoritz on 2 January. Some aircraft are probably parked in the hangars. The total strength of the two ground attack regiments is estimated at approximately 90 to 100 aircraft.\n\n25X1A ** Comment. According to previous observations, the marking reported is typical of the ground attack regiments stationed in Doeoritz. The third regiment assigned to the same division has the leading edge of the rudder assembly painted blue.\n\n25X1A *** Comment. This marking is reported for the first time.",
