  "transcription": "Approved For Release 2005/04/13 : CIA-RDP79R00967A000800040003-7\n\nSECRET\n\n3. Most important of all, Comrade Chairman, the chief significance and indeed the very end of the 38th Parallel Concept as conceived and implemented by this component eludes our academic colleagues. They fail to note that Peiping is also in close proximity to the 38th Parallel. Our assets are now being mobilized for the supreme effort in the East. As you know, Comrade Mikoyan has gone underground and will reappear shortly as General Mee Koo Ya. Arrangements have been made for him to penetrate quickly to the very heart of the deviationist clique now in control in Peiping and we trust that doctrinal and disciplinary purity will shortly be restored in our brother Communist state. Accommodations for Mao and Chou in their retirement years have been arranged on Brioni Island.\n\n4. We trust that some days after news of these events has appeared in Pravda, the Board of National Estimates will favor you with a \"brilliant discovery\" of them.\n\n-2-\n\nApproved For Release 2005/04/13 : CIA-RDP79R00967A000800040003-7",
