  "transcription": "PURM NO. 51-4B\nDEC 1951\nApproved For Release 2001/08/02 : CIA-RDP81-01036R000100050025-9\nU.S. Officials Only\nSECRET\nSECURITY INFORMATION\nCENTRAL INTELLIGENCE AGENCY\nINFORMATION REPORT\nCOUNTRY Germany (Soviet Zone)\nSUBJECT Zeiss-Jena Works Gyro-sight Manufacture\n25X1A\n\nRESPONSIVE TO\n1 2\nCD NO. \nOO/C NO. \nORR NO. \nDAS NO. \nOCI NO. \nDATE DISTR. 4DEC 53\nNO. OF PAGES 1\nNO. OF ENCLS.\nSUPP. TO\nREPORT NO.\n\nThe former German optical sighting apparatus Type Al has been taken out of production at the Zeiss-Jena works. A gyro-sight is being manufactured instead, after Soviet specifications. It is equipped with a periscope in some cases. Production has just commenced and six pieces have been manufactured.\n\n- end -\n\n744.15 4/M/C\n4/744.15 4/M/C\n\nU.S. Officials Only\nSECRET\nSECURITY INFORMATION\nDISTRIBUTION STATE ARMY NAVY AIR FBI\nApproved For Release 2001/08/02 : CIA-RDP81-01036R000100050025-9",
