  "transcription": "TOP SECRET CHESS RUFF\nApproved For Release 2001/08/21 : CIA-RDP78B04560A000200010048-4\n\nSUMMARY\nSTATUS OF COMOR TARGET READOUT\nA TOTAL OF 12 COMOR TARGETS WERE OBSERVED DURING THE CURRENT REPORTING PERIOD AND ARE COVERED BY THIS REPORT.\n\nSUMMARY OF MISSILE ACTIVITY\nTHE FOLLOWING IS A COMPILATION OF MISSILE LAUNCH FACILITIES (INCLUDING PROBABLES AND POSSIBLES) OBSERVED TO DATE ON MISSION 9037. THIS COMPLIATION INCLUDES ONLY THOSE FACILITIES WHICH HAVE BEEN IDENTIFIED FOR THE FIRST TIME FROM PHOTOGRAPHY --\nICBM LAUNCH AREAS -- 2\nMRBM LAUNCH SITES -- 2\nSA-3 SAM LAUNCH SITES -- 1\n\nHIGHLIGHTS\nAN ICBM LAUNCH COMPLEX CONTAINING TWO LAUNCH AREAS SIMILAR TO THOSE AT TYUMEN HAS BEEN IDENTIFIED 30 NM NW OF KRASNOYARK.\n\nTWO INLINE MRBM LAUNCH SITES HAVE BEEN NEWLY IDENTIFIED -- ONE 2.5 NM NW OF NIGRANGE AND ONE 15.3 NM WSW OF MARINA GORKA (BONUS 1).\nAN SA-3 SAM SITE IN A LATE STAGE OF CONSTRUCTION HAS BEEN IDENTIFIED 20.5 NM WNW OF LENINGRAD. (BONUS 2).",
