  "transcription": "Approved For Release 2000/08/08 : CIA-RDP96-00789R000500040016-6\nUNCLASSIFIED\nWORKING PAPER\n8910-04 (W-3)\n891005\nV: 079\nS: 01\n\nSUMMARY OF INFORMATION\n\nDuring this session, I could see lights surrounding people's bodies. I then could see a light sitting on an individual's head. The light was bouncing off a woman's head as she was walking.\n\nI then could see a man wearing a helmet and he was going into some type of square box. The impression I had here was flight. The man was entering the square box. The square box reminded me of a cockpit. I then could see a bright colored umbrella type object that opened and closed. The object may have been an air balloon. The impression I received here was skydiving.\n\nI then could see a big slab of thick rock. The rock was gray and black The letters e, s, and t were written on the rock in white chalk. I was standing on a bridge. I looked down to see water but I saw a concrete road instead. There was no one here.\n\nI saw a man and it looked like he was standing up in a small canoe. The man looked like he was trying to get someone's attention.\n\nI could see a big black and white plastic fish flying in the sky.",
